{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "fda09e7f9b92e74b8e875819c3b963cf48a7aa8c9d8c44dd2a3e6e4bd7412383", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、大変だよ！\n今この撮影現場で、大変なコトが起きてるよ！", "zh": "小{$P$}，糟糕了！\n这个拍摄现场正在发生不得了的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ffb380134db09a9890565224dbbb70e3d6124a656b9910a8324e59be3c60715b", "ja": "どうした、茜？\n撮影は順調だったのに、何か問題でも起きたのか。", "zh": "茜，怎么了？\n拍摄过程非常顺利呀，是有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "951055230d06e2312c96c91d19b2036e2f8eb685c6d899c58b07fabc0e6d8f2e", "ja": "それだよ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n順調すぎて、茜ちゃんの出番がなくなっちゃったよ！", "zh": "就是这点啊，小{$P$}！\n太顺利了，害小茜都没有戏份了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9a4e9b30fbcbdb51e3251b49b0e4ca8ea96f7ea43957044f27312bb0d96f7148", "ja": "お、おう……。まあ、そうだな。", "zh": "这、这样啊……哎呀，这也没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "832f1806d31b0161312e45dda1758940d009a8bc97808825a67ab75b0aabf8ec", "ja": "ファンタジーの盗賊っていえば、最高の\nトラブルメーカーだよ？　一番オイシイ役柄じゃん！", "zh": "奇幻故事里的盗贼，不都是最让人\n头痛的麻烦制造者吗？是最出风头的角色啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "6294a91f83232263c144f8aa0a79039d2ab8fa630cb04274a507cafe022c1836", "ja": "それなのに、千早ちゃんと杏奈ちゃんに捕まって\nおしまいなんて……もったいない、あーもったいない！", "zh": "但小茜被小千早和小杏奈抓到以后就没戏份了……\n可惜、太可惜啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "51c72e491622e26e31bbf30cf935f322d376c3bdffba6d6612d343c5254e2759", "ja": "というわけだから、監督におねだりしに行こう！\nさぁ、{$P$}ちゃん！　レッツゴー！", "zh": "所以啰，我们一起去拜托导演吧！\n来，小{$P$}！Let's Go！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1007_p", "source_sha256": "22490709438d3b667ba635f2f070c4bf91856b18a8260e323056a99bb64d57d7", "ja": "えっ、今から！？\nお、おい……待て、茜ー！", "zh": "咦？现在吗！？\n喂、喂……等等啊，茜──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0082_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ace608f82afc9477d6394167cc1fe615e9c1abb6f036ca95525f4719afa4f3e4", "ja": "（出番は増やせなかったが「やる気があっていいね」と\n監督にほめられた……トラブルメーカー、適役だな！）", "zh": "（戏份虽然没有变多，但导演称赞她\n「很有干劲，真棒」……真是称职的麻烦制造者啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
